From b90b514a19f87c53dad8c8f6ba34cf541c08da60 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lorenzo Ferro <lorenzo.ferro@polito.it>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 11:22:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] ima,bpf: measure BPF program contents and link lifecycle

Add the BPF_CHECK IMA policy hook, unify canonical BPF program payload
SHA-256 hashing in the verifier with upstream signature verification, and
record BPF program load/unload and BPF link lifecycle events (attach,
update, detach, release) in a compact 56-byte ima-buf record.
